{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29030","headline":"南亭夜坐贻开元禅定二道者 · 许浑","name":"南亭夜坐贻开元禅定二道者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮暮焚香何处宿，西岩一室映疎藤。\n光阴难驻迹如客，寒暑不惊心似僧。\n高树有风闻夜磬，远山无月见秋灯。\n身闲境静日爲乐，若问其余非我能。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}